  "description": "Free retirement savings calculator: enter your current age, retirement age, current savings, monthly contribution, and expected return to see your projected nest egg at retirement, a safe monthly income estimate via the 4% rule, and a year-by-year growth schedule. No login, no ads, computed in your browser.",
